# Inputs and initial exclusions for the model sieve in 14.7.68

The quotient inputs verify the hypotheses for A.3.14 on the actual images
in Gᵤ/O₂(Gᵤ), identify the component image with Lᵤ/O₂(Lᵤ), and compare
that quotient with C.2.7's star image through the actual central-kernel map.
The A₅ and index-fifteen A-hat₆ alternatives are excluded.

The remaining block/Borel and linear-parabolic comparisons, and the
construction of the marked local star residual, are unfinished. This module
does not yet export the requested `ReducedModels` theorem. Final assembly
remains here. The universal full A.3.14 source producer is
qt-a03-embeddings / qt-a-03; no classification substitute is assumed.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, combined manuscript (1 March 2004),
A.3.14, pp.49–50; C.2.7, pp.145–147; 14.7.68(2), pp.1071–1072.
-/
